# CLAUDE.md — Working Memory for {{OWNER_FIRST_NAME}}

## Session Start Protocol
1. Read this file first
2. Run `python3 ~/Desktop/claude/tools/memory_search.py wake-up` — ~200 tokens of fresh context (recent interactions, active projects, stale contacts)
3. Based on user's message, detect goal and load relevant memory files
4. See `skills/second-brain/SKILL.md` (if installed) for full retrieval logic

---

## Rules

Standing rules live in `~/.claude/rules/critical-rules.md` (loaded every session). One checker agent for things that ship - code merged to main, public posts, outbound messages. Everything else runs without one.

